  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3006.02 Transfer of ERCs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3006.02 Transfer of ERCs. An ERC certificate and the ERCs represented thereon shall be transferable among and between persons and the state upon 7 days prior written notice to the department. Any person and the state shall be able to transfer any amount of ERCs at any time during the calendar year as provided in this chapter.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
